<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Oct palm oil exports 729,626t-Caleb Brett.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Oct palm oil exports 729,626t-Caleb Brett.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's October bulk palm oil exports at 729,626 tonnes against its estimate of 671,612 for September, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The official Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put September exports at 637,079 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
